This repository is a modified version of the original work, distributed under
the same license (GPL-3.0). The upstream history is preserved in git; changes
made in this fork start after upstream release 2.1.0 (commit 9f86e22).

Changes in this fork (summary):
  - Simplified Chinese web panel
  - In-panel live camera viewer through go2rtc; stream-probe reasons;
    in-place go2rtc stream updates
  - Redaction of secret query values in process and panel logs
  - T6 privacy-mode settings and read-only camera position
  - T6 camera pan/flip buttons; the device helpers are generated byte for
    byte by addon/tools/ptz-helper/build_ptz.py and contain no vendor code
  - T6 reset_bagbox action (resets the bag usage counter only)

Third-party components keep their own notices (for example
addon/petkit_local/web/static/bin/LICENSE.dropbear and the go2rtc LICENSE
next to the vendored player script).

